{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And Korah assembled against them.</b> With words of mockery. That whole night he went to the tribes and seduced them: 'Do you suppose that I alone am indignant? I am indignant only for the sake of all of you — these come and seize all the high offices: to him the kingship, and to his brother the priesthood' — until they were all seduced (there)." "<b>And the glory of YHWH appeared.</b> It came in a pillar of cloud."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:11:17.810174817Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}